			"notes": "### v1.3\n- 通用更新：\n  - 将dc引擎版本升级到2.1.3；\n  - 性能优化。\n  - 添加[anisum](https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/Anisum)支持。现在可以在neoforge下显示创造模式物品栏了！\n- 森罗物语：酒馆：\n  - 黑板功能更新：\n    - 取消3行和5字符限制，现在每块黑板可写的总字数为54字；\n- 森罗物语：厨房\n  - 新增：切面包机\n    - 可将面包放入切面包机中，关盖后潜行互动切面包，完成后潜行可将面包片取出来。\n- 森罗物语：书房\n  - 新增：别烦我盒子\n    - 右键互动打开盒子，触发随机关闭盒子效果。\n- 森罗物语：烹饪扩展包\n  - 对灶台进行了性能优化。\n\n---\n\n- General Update:\n  - Upgraded the DC engine version to 2.1.3;\n  - Performance optimization.\n  -Added [anisum] (https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/Anisum) support. Now, the crafting item bar in the creation mode can be displayed in Neoforge!\n- Kaleidoscope Bar：\n  -  Update of the blackboard:\n    - Removed the 3-line and 5-character limit. Now, the total number of characters that can be written on each blackboard is 54;\n- Kaleidoscope Cookery:\n  - Added: Bread Slicer\n    - You can put bread in the bread slicer, close the lid and interact while sneaking to cut the bread. After completion, you can sneak and take out the bread slices.\n- Kaleidoscope Lab\n  - Added: Leave Me Alone Box\n    - Interact to open the box, while triggering the random closing effect of the box.\n- Kaleidoscope Cookery Extension Pack:\n  - Optimized the performance of the Stove."
